    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Hence, the following order :-\nPankaj Dattatray Turekar vs The State Of Maharashtra on 2 December, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51930438/\n1 (a) In the event of arrest of the Applicant in C.R.No.1417/2022 registered with Hadapsar Police Station, Dist. Pune, he shall be released on interim bail till the next date of hearing, on furnishing bail bonds in the sum of Rs.25,000/- with one or two sureties in the like amount ;\n(b) The Applicant shall report to the Investigating Officer for two days from 05/12/2022 between 11:00 a.m. to 02:00 p.m. and further as and when required by the Investigating Officer ;\n(c) The Applicant shall keep the Investigating Officer informed of his current address and mobile contact numbers, and/or change of residence or mobile details, if any,\nfrom time to time.\n4. Stand over to 14/12/2022.\nPREETI H JAYANI (SMT. ANUJA PRABHUDESSAI, J.)\nPankaj Dattatray Turekar vs The State Of Maharashtra on 2 December, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51930438/\n2",
